abstract: >-
  SYNTHETIC toy and browser game. A drawn 12 x 12 pattern is stored in a small
  associative memory; a fragment recalls the whole pattern, a refusing gate says
  no when nothing matches, and recalled patterns are sonified. Classical
  JavaScript, no dependencies. Not a brain-computer interface, not mind-reading,
  not an optical hologram.
keywords:
  - associative-memory
  - toy-model
  - synthetic
